{"id":"6007c8bd31b5cfde","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-brauer.md","title":"Brauer Induction Theorem","display":"thm-brauer — Brauer Induction Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-brauer","aliases":["58-thm-brauer"],"display":"thm-brauer — Brauer Induction Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-p-group.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-brauer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-brauer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-brauer — Brauer Induction Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md\">../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ac978c566ec8e658\" href=\"?note=ac978c566ec8e658\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-p-group.md\">../batch08/58-df-p-group.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\cdot\\in V\">\\(G,\\cdot\\in V\\)</span> (finite group data, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\)</span> (group predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{\\mathbb C}(G)\">\\(R_{\\mathbb C}(G)\\)</span> (复表示环)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\operatorname{Elem}(G)\\)</span> (elementary subgroups: products of a cyclic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p&#39;\">\\(p&#39;\\)</span>-group with a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-group)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}brauer}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(G)\\to\n\\forall\\chi\\in R_{\\mathbb C}(G)\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists(E_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\operatorname{Elem}(G)^m\\;\n\\exists(n_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathbb Z^m\\;\\exists(\\theta_i)_{i&lt;m}\\;\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;m}\\operatorname{LinearCharacter}(\\theta_i,E_i)\n\\land\\chi=\\sum_{i&lt;m}n_i\\operatorname{Ind}_{E_i}^G\\theta_i\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}brauer}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(G)\\to\n\\forall\\chi\\in R_{\\mathbb C}(G)\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists(E_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\operatorname{Elem}(G)^m\\;\n\\exists(n_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathbb Z^m\\;\\exists(\\theta_i)_{i&lt;m}\\;\n\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;m}\\operatorname{LinearCharacter}(\\theta_i,E_i)\n\\land\\chi=\\sum_{i&lt;m}n_i\\operatorname{Ind}_{E_i}^G\\theta_i\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>此处明确采用 Brauer 诱导定理；“Brauer's theorem”在块论中有多个不同结果，原投射特征标表述并不成立。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k(B)\">\\(k(B)\\)</span> (Külshammer): number of irreducible chars in block <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Brauer's <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k(B)\">\\(k(B)\\)</span>-conjecture: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k(B) \\leq |D(B)|\">\\(k(B) \\leq |D(B)|\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Height zero conjecture: defect group bounds character heights.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md","status":"resolved","id":"59685d062adf2748","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-p-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ac978c566ec8e658","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-p-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G,\\cdot\\in V$ (finite group data, see [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$